sequenceDiagram
  actor S as Student
  participant C as Client
  participant E as Experiment Service
  participant A as Assessment / Readiness Engine
  participant F as Safety Engine
  participant DB as Database

  S->>C: select experiment
  C->>E: POST /experiments/{id}/session
  E->>F: check certification tier
  F->>DB: read Certification
  DB-->>F: tier status
  F-->>E: certified / not certified
  E->>A: request readiness assessment
  A->>DB: read prerequisites + prior Attempts
  A-->>C: serve theory + safety questions
  C->>A: submit answers
  A->>DB: store Attempt
  A-->>E: readiness decision
  E->>DB: create ExperimentSession (if permitted)
  E-->>C: session token / access denied
  C-->>S: enter laboratory or show gap feedback
